/**
 * @ingroup simd_c_api.cube_datamove.cube_compute_load
 * @brief Copies matrix data from Global Memory to L1 Buffer where no padding is applied, moving n_burst blocks of
 * len_burst 32-byte DataBlocks with configurable source and destination gaps.
 *
 * @override_id asc_copy_gm2l1__PL1v_PGv_u16_u16_u16_u16
 * @archs 2201
 * @param [out] dst Start address of the destination block in L1 Buffer (__cbuf__); the transfer writes this region.
 * @param [in] src Start address of the source matrix data in Global Memory; only read by the transfer.
 * @param [in] n_burst Number of consecutive transfer blocks to move; documented range [1, 4095].
 * @param [in] len_burst Length of each transfer block in DataBlocks of 32 bytes; documented range [1, 65535].
 * @param [in] src_gap Gap between the end of one source block and the start of the next, in DataBlocks of 32 bytes.
 * @param [in] dst_gap Gap between the end of one destination block and the start of the next, in DataBlocks of 32
 * bytes.
 */
